        "original_id": "72cd4276-ab25-5251-a455-6b79578b3b12",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Microchip Technology, Keurig Green Mountain\n- Products: PICkit, PIC microcontrollers, Microchip semiconductor products\n\nFacts:\n- Keurig Green Mountain, formerly Green Mountain Coffee Roasters, is a specialty coffee and coffeemaker company founded in 1981 and headquartered in the United States.\n- Microchip Technology is an American manufacturer of microcontroller, memory, and analog semiconductors.\n- Microchip Technology’s products include microcontrollers such as PICmicro, dsPIC/PIC24, PIC32, AVR, AVR32, and SAM.\n- Microchip Technology’s products also include Serial EEPROM devices, Serial SRAM devices, KEELOQ devices, radio frequency devices, thermal devices, power and battery management analog devices, and linear, interface, and mixed signal devices.\n- PICkit is a family of programmers for PIC microcontrollers made by Microchip Technology.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
